erious dimensions, strange creatures, fragments of lost memories... and voices that may exist only in your head.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you dive deeper into the worlds between worlds, you begin to realize: you are here for a reason.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772380/extras/3371a79f5d7b0a0515dfd6cfbed283a5.poster.avif?t=1755245338\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772380/extras/3371a79f5d7b0a0515dfd6cfbed283a5.webm?t=1755245338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2772380/extras/3371a79f5d7b0a0515dfd6cfbed283a5.mp4?t=1755245338\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every door, every question, every whisper \u2014 it\u2019s all part of you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But do you truly want to remember the truth?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Features:</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of puzzles that will test your logic, observation, and imagination.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An intriguing story with unexpected twists, told through details: there are no long cutscenes here \u2014 every element of the world carries a hidden meaning.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dimensions unlike each other \u2014 from 3D worlds where skeletons cannot speak, to 2D worlds with no sound at all, from places where everything has already happened to those where everything is still ahead.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unusual characters: some will help, some will challenge you, and some will ask questions you might fear to answer.</p>[/][]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack that reflects your emotional state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragra